{
  "key": 4051,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_Route10_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_EveryTypeStrongerThanOthers",
      "en_US": [
        "The types of Pokémon match up\n",
        "differently with each other.\r",
        "Every type is stronger than some\n",
        "types and weaker than others."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_Route10_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_NuggetUselessSoldFor5000",
      "en_US": [
        "A Nugget is totally useless.\n",
        "So I sold it for ¥5000."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_Route10_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HeardGhostsHauntLavender",
      "en_US": [
        "I heard that ghosts haunt\n",
        "Lavender Town."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_Route10_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_GiveEverstoneIfCaught20Mons",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh… {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "I’ve been looking for you!\r",
        "It’s me, one of the ever-present\n",
        "Aides to Prof. Oak.\r",
        "If your Pokédex has complete data\n",
        "on twenty species, I’m supposed to\f",
        "give you a reward from Prof. Oak.\r",
        "He entrusted me with this\n",
        "Everstone.\r",
        "So, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, let me ask you.\r",
        "Have you gathered data on at least\n",
        "twenty kinds of Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_Route10_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_GreatHereYouGo",
      "en_US": [
        "Great! You have caught or owned\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} kinds of Pokémon!\r",
        "Congratulations!\n",
        "Here you go!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_Route10_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ReceivedEverstoneFromAide",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received the Everstone\n",
        "from the Aide."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_Route10_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ExplainEverstone",
      "en_US": [
        "Making Pokémon evolve certainly\n",
        "can add to the Pokédex.\r",
        "However, at times, you may not\n",
        "want a certain Pokémon to evolve.\r",
        "In that case, give the Everstone\n",
        "to that Pokémon.\r",
        "It will prevent evolution according\n",
        "to the Professor."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_Aide_Text_GetEnoughMonsComeBackForItem",
      "en_US": [
        "…Oh. I see.\r",
        "When you get {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} kinds of Pokémon,\n",
        "come back for the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_Aide_Text_HaventCaughtEnoughMonsForItem",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s see…\n",
        "Uh-oh! You have caught only\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} kinds of Pokémon!\r",
        "You need {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} kinds\n",
        "if you want the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_Aide_Text_DontHaveAnyRoomForItem",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! I see you don’t have any\n",
        "room for the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_Text_DescribeWhichGame",
      "en_US": [
        "I can explain game rules to you,\n",
        "if you’d like.\r",
        "Which game should I describe?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_cv_mc_wireless_minigame_0",
      "en_US": "Pokémon Jump"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_cv_mc_wireless_minigame_1",
      "en_US": "Dodrio Berry-Picking"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_cv_mc_wireless_minigame_2",
      "en_US": "Exit"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_Text_PokemonJumpInfo",
      "en_US": [
        "“Pokémon Jump”\r",
        "Make your Pokémon skip the Vine Whip\n",
        "rope with the A Button.\r",
        "Only mini Pokémon around 28 inches\n",
        "or less may participate.\r",
        "Pokémon that only swim, burrow,\n",
        "or fly are not good at jumping.\r",
        "As a result, those Pokémon may not\n",
        "participate.\r",
        "Good things happen if everyone\n",
        "jumps in time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_Text_DodrioBerryPickingInfo",
      "en_US": [
        "“Dodrio Berry-Picking”\r",
        "Command Dodrio’s three heads to\n",
        "catch falling Berries.\r",
        "Press right, up, or left on the\n",
        " Control Pad to move the heads.\r",
        "To play this game, you must have\n",
        "a Dodrio."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_MossdeepCity_GameCorner_1F_Text_TalkToOldManToPlay",
      "en_US": [
        "If you want to play a game,\n",
        "please tell the old man beside me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0342_R10PC0101_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
